# Build context exclusions for web/server.
#
# `Containerfile` does `COPY /app .`, so anything not listed here ships inside
# the production image. Tests, caches, and local virtualenvs do not belong there:
# they inflate the image, and a test file that imports pytest in production is
# noise at best.

# Tests — none of these are imported by the application.
**/test_*.py
**/*_test.py

# Test-only helpers (testcontainers wrappers). Application code never imports
# this package; only the *_test.py files do, and those are excluded above.
#
# Patterns are relative to the build context root (`web/server`), not to the
# WORKDIR, so the path includes the leading `app/`.
app/services/testing

# Python caches and local environments.
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
.venv
.pytest_cache
.mypy_cache
.ruff_cache

# Editor and OS noise.
.DS_Store
*.swp

# Deployment metadata that is not part of the app.
Containerfile
.containerignore
